  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continue the previous work with elaborating detailed tender documents in order to allow for an international call for tenders to construct the new waste deposit at the Urban community of Oujda. Additional decisions Inec 966/03 om 915 000 SEK och Inec 541/04 om 950 000 SEK.</narrative>
